{"ts": 1784365250.8743913, "event": "finish", "summary": "Held the entire episode. This short entry moved favorably almost immediately (+40pts by t=1m) and kept making new favorable highs through t=29m (peaked near +175pts), with periodic pullbacks of 40-75% of the leg amplitude that never approached breakeven or threatened the entry thesis. There was never a stretch where price traded against the position toward zero/negative -- every dip was a giveback within an otherwise strongly favorable trade, so nothing met the wrong-direction bar. Next time I'd watch for a pullback that actually closes in on the zero line or a sustained run of against-fires (HA/PROPP/KMDR/CLIMAX) coinciding with lower highs AND lower lows in favorable-points terms, not just chop within a still-very-profitable range.", "exit_frame": null, "n_commits": 42}
